  "statuteText": "281-A:4-b Work Certificate for Contractors Before Beginning Their Work on Public Projects. –\n\nThe commissioner of labor shall provide a work certificate form to meet the requirements of the departments of transportation and administrative services, in accordance with RSA 228:4-b or RSA 21-I:80, VI, for contractors, subcontractors, and independent contractors to certify their compliance with RSA 281-A."
